\newlabel{tab:results}{{5.1}{48}{Results of the nominal maximum likelihood fit. {\bf \textcolor {red}{The results are blind}} (see equation \ref {eq:BlindtoUnblind}). For the alternative configurations used to evaluate the systematic uncertainties, the difference $\Delta $ with respect to the results of the {\bf \textcolor {blue}{nominal fits}} are reported. The $\Delta $ values shown in {\bf bold}, are the ones summed in quadrature to obtain the total systematic uncertainty reported in Tab.~\ref {tab:syst}}{table.5.1}{}}
